    "date": "2026-11-24",
    "kind": "Component sync",
    "summary": "CPRMV v0.4.3, in production: a RuleSet is now an FRBR Endeavor and methods come in modules; the API reads organisations, norms and DSO decision models as sources, returns the original publication through /raw, narrows /methods to one method, drops the EU CELLAR helpers and serves its MCP server at /mcp/; the specification gains new introductory chapters, a diagram per class and a PDF.",
    "previous": {
      "date": "2026-11-22",
      "kind": "Component sync and weekly pass",
      "summary": "CPSV Editor v2026.11.2 and Linked Data Explorer v2026.11.3, both in production: the editor imports each statement whole and reads a field only from its own property, its publish dialog shows the steps publishing really takes, and a lapsed session asks to sign in again; the Linked Data Explorer accepts only access tokens, says when sign-in cannot be checked, explains a failed publish, and reports a required service described elsewhere as a warning; the weekly pass then re-checked the contributing pages and the Project Start Architectuur against all five components, recording that zizmor is now installed from hash-locked wheels and adding a risk for the citizen service number in the browser and the incomplete lookup audit; the ICTU dependency guideline holds at 42, 40 and 40."
